# Copy to .dev.vars for local `wrangler dev`. Never commit .dev.vars.
# At least one GitHub Personal Access Token. Add more (PAT_2, PAT_3, ...) to
# enable token rotation. Classic PAT with `read:user`, `repo` (for private
# stats) scopes, or a fine-grained token with equivalent read access.
PAT_1=ghp_your_token_here
# PAT_2=ghp_second_token
